426		 * Get the contents of an <code>InputStream</code> as a <code>byte[]</code>.
427		 * <p/>
428		 * This method buffers the input internally, so there is no need to use a
429		 * <code>BufferedInputStream</code>.
430		 *
431		 * @param input the <code>InputStream</code> to read from
432		 * @return the requested byte array
433		 * @throws NullPointerException if the input is null
434		 * @throws java.io.IOException  if an I/O error occurs
435		 */
436		public static byte[] toByteArray(InputStream input) throws IOException
